  "title": "Answer: measurement is a proto-volitional event",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "12408d44-9766-4ea4-98a4-7627765f7f35",
      "text": "A measurement is an event in which a system in a state produces an outcome in another system, the inner side of which is a proto-volitional choice. Objects are known only through such events.",
